","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes embedding-based deep learning for multimodal oncology data integration, which is predictive rather than generative. It does not provide evidence of a foundation-model-style generative architecture.","evidence_snippet":"\"Embedding-Based Deep Learning Frameworks for Multimodal Oncology Data Integration\""},{"record_id":"rec_003261","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly identifies the work as a survey of biomedical data analysis with LLMs. No new generative model is described.","evidence_snippet":"\"The large language models on biomedical data analysis: a survey\""},{"record_id":"rec_003262","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a comprehensive review of LLM applications in bioinformatics, not a primary model description. The abstract discusses applications and challenges rather than a specific generative foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"This comprehensive review systematically examines the development and applications of LLMs in bioinformatics\""},{"record_id":"rec_003263","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title states that this is a survey of multimodal LLMs in biomedical engineering and healthcare. That makes it a review rather than a primary generative model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"A Survey of Multimodal Large Language Models in Biomedical Engineering and Healthcare\""},{"record_id":"rec_003264","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_eviden