./data/screening_codex_fulltext_2026-07-09/role_logs/adjudicator/batch_0035.stderr.log:62:- A method that uses frozen/external LLM embeddings, prompts, labels, explanations, prototypes, or text-derived features only for a downstream classifier, annotation system, risk model, or predictor is `application_wrapper` unless the abstract presents a central multimodal text-bio model or generator.
